  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 715.09 Treatment Technique for Control of Disinfection Byproduct Precursors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 715.09 Treatment Technique for Control of Disinfection Byproduct Precursors. The O/O of a SW/GWUDISW system that is in one of the categories listed in Env-Dw 715.02 and that uses conventional filtration shall meet the requirements of 40 CFR § 141.135 relative to treatment techniques for control of disinfection byproduct precursors.\n\nSource. #9619, eff 1-1-10; ss by #12532, eff 6-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
